{%- layout none -%}
{%- comment -%} Geschenk-Finder "Der Wunschbrief". Daten live über collection.gf (?view=gf). Bilder: gf-paper.webp, gf-seal.webp, gf-box.jpg, gf-bg.jpg. Claude 21.11.2026 {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign gf_l = request.locale.iso_code | slice: 0, 2 -%}
{%- assign gf_root = routes.root_url -%}{%- if gf_root == '/' -%}{%- assign gf_root = '' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- capture gf_t -%}{%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}Gift Finder: The Wish Letter | Black Elixir{%- when 'fr' -%}Guide cadeaux : La Lettre de vœux | Black Elixir{%- when 'it' -%}Trova regalo: La Lettera dei desideri | Black Elixir{%- when 'da' -%}Gavefinder: Ønskebrevet | Black Elixir{%- when 'ar' -%}دليل الهدايا: رسالة الأمنيات | Black Elixir{%- when 'he' -%}מוצא המתנות: מכתב המשאלות | Black Elixir{%- else -%}Geschenk-Finder: Der Wunschbrief | Black Elixir{%- endcase -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture gf_d -%}{%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}Find the right perfume gift in five quick questions: for her, for him or for everyone, within your budget. Three suggestions from the Black Elixir range.{%- when 'fr' -%}Trouve le parfum à offrir en cinq petites questions : pour elle, pour lui ou pour tous, selon ton budget. Trois suggestions issues de la sélection Black Elixir.{%- when 'it' -%}Trova il profumo giusto da regalare in cinque brevi domande: per lei, per lui o per tutti, nel tuo budget. Tre proposte dall'assortimento di Black Elixir.{%- when 'da' -%}Find den rette parfumegave med fem korte spørgsmål: til hende, til ham eller til alle, inden for dit budget. Tre forslag fra Black Elixirs sortiment.{%- when 'ar' -%}اعثر على هدية العطر المناسبة في خمسة أسئلة قصيرة: لها أو له أو للجميع، وضمن ميزانيتك. ثلاثة اقتراحات من تشكيلة Black Elixir.{%- when 'he' -%}חמש שאלות קצרות ותמצא את מתנת הבושם המתאימה: בשבילה, בשבילו או לכולם, בתקציב שלך. שלוש הצעות מהמבחר של Black Elixir.{%- else -%}Finde in fünf kurzen Fragen das passende Parfum-Geschenk: für sie, für ihn oder für alle, in deinem Budget. Drei Vorschläge aus dem Sortiment von Black Elixir.{%- endcase -%}{%- endcapture -%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}"{% if gf_l == 'ar' or gf_l == 'he' %} dir="rtl"{% endif %}>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<title>{{ gf_t }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ gf_d }}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}">
{%- for l in localization.available_languages -%}{%- assign lr = l.root_url -%}{%- if lr == '/' -%}{%- assign lr = '' -%}{%- endif %}
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="{{ l.iso_code }}" href="{{ request.origin }}{{ lr }}{{ page.url }}">
{%- endfor %}
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="{{ request.origin }}{{ page.url }}">
<link rel="icon" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 64 }}">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="BLACK ELIXIR"><meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ gf_t }}"><meta property="og:description" content="{{ gf_d }}"><meta property="og:url" content="{{ canonical_url }}">
<meta property="og:image" content="https:{{ images['gf-box.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1200, height: 630, crop: 'center' }}"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=Pinyon+Script&family=Jost:wght@400;500&display=swap">
{%- if gf_l == 'ar' %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Aref+Ruqaa&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&display=swap">{% endif -%}
{%- if gf_l == 'he' %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playpen+Sans+Hebrew&family=Frank+Ruhl+Libre:wght@400;500&display=swap">{% endif %}
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="{{ images['gf-paper.webp'] | image_url: width: 1100 }}">
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":{{ gf_t | json }},"description":{{ gf_d | json }},"url":{{ canonical_url | json }},"inLanguage":{{ request.locale.iso_code | json }},"isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"BLACK ELIXIR – Maison de Parfum","url":{{ request.origin | json }}}}</script>
{{ content_for_header }}
<style>
:root{
  --night:#0f1c18; --night2:#16261f; --paper:#f4ede0; --paper2:#ebe1cf; --ink:#24201a; --mute:#6f675b;
  --wax:#8d1e24; --wax2:#b5333a; --gold:#bf9a55; --gold2:#e2c88f; --mist:#a6b4ad; --line:rgba(244,237,224,.16);
  --serif:'Cormorant Garamond',Didot,'Times New Roman',serif; --script:'Pinyon Script','Snell Roundhand',cursive; --sans:'Jost','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;
  color-scheme:dark;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{background:var(--night);margin:0}
html{overflow-x:clip}
.letter{overflow:visible}
.seal{transform-origin:70% 70%}
body{color:var(--paper);font:400 16px/1.6 var(--sans);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;padding-inline:16px;min-height:100vh;
  background:linear-gradient(rgba(10,20,16,.55),rgba(10,20,16,.78)),url({{ images['gf-bg.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1920 }}) center top/cover fixed,var(--night)}
@media (max-width:860px){body{background-attachment:scroll,scroll,scroll}}
a{color:inherit}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit}
.wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding-block:28px 64px}
header.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.brand{font:500 12px/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none}
.skip{font-size:13px;color:var(--mist);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.05fr);gap:clamp(24px,5vw,64px);align-items:start;margin-top:clamp(24px,4vw,48px)}

/* question side */
.q{position:relative}
.kick{font:500 11px/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold)}
h1{font:400 clamp(40px,5.6vw,72px)/1 var(--serif);margin:.35em 0 .3em;text-wrap:balance}
h1 i{color:var(--gold2)}
.lead{color:#d9d2c4;max-width:30em;margin:0 0 28px}
.prog{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mist);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.bar{flex:1;height:2px;background:var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.bar i{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;background:var(--gold);transition:width .5s}
h2{font:400 clamp(30px,3.4vw,44px)/1.1 var(--serif);margin:0 0 20px;text-wrap:balance}
.opts{display:grid;gap:10px}
.opt{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;background:rgba(244,237,224,.04);border:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:15px 18px;border-radius:2px;transition:background .2s,border-color .2s}
.opt:hover{background:rgba(244,237,224,.08);border-color:rgba(191,154,85,.6)}
.opt:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold2);outline-offset:2px}
.opt b{font:500 17px/1.25 var(--sans);display:block}
.opt small{display:block;color:var(--mist);font-size:13.5px;margin-top:2px}
.opt .k{flex:none;width:30px;height:30px;border:1px solid rgba(191,154,85,.55);border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font:italic 400 17px/1 var(--serif);color:var(--gold2)}
.nav{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:20px;font-size:14px;color:var(--mist)}
.nav button{background:none;border:0;padding:6px 0;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.go{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--gold);color:#17120a;border:0;padding:15px 28px;font:500 13px/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}
.go:hover{background:var(--gold2)}
.go:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--paper);outline-offset:3px}

/* the letter */
.letter{position:relative;color:#1f2433;padding:clamp(44px,6vw,72px) clamp(40px,6vw,74px) clamp(70px,8vw,96px);min-height:600px;
  background:url({{ images['gf-paper.webp'] | image_url: width: 1100 }}) center/100% 100% no-repeat;filter:drop-shadow(0 30px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.55)) drop-shadow(0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.35));transform:rotate(.8deg)}
.letter .ink{color:#1d2436}
.lhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;font:500 10.5px/1.4 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a6f5f;margin-bottom:26px}
.lhead span:last-child{text-align:right}
.lines{font:400 clamp(27px,2.7vw,36px)/46px var(--script);color:#1d2436;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;min-height:276px;text-shadow:0 0 .4px rgba(29,36,54,.6)}
.lines li{white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;width:0;animation:write 1.1s steps(40,end) forwards}
.lines li.done{width:auto;animation:none;white-space:normal}
@keyframes write{to{width:100%}}
.sig{font:400 clamp(27px,2.7vw,36px)/46px var(--script);color:#1d2436;margin-top:8px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .6s}
.sig.on{opacity:1}
.seal{position:absolute;right:clamp(26px,5vw,60px);bottom:-30px;width:clamp(96px,11vw,132px);height:auto;opacity:0;transform:scale(1.35) rotate(-18deg);filter:drop-shadow(0 6px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.45))}
.seal.on{animation:stamp .55s cubic-bezier(.2,1.6,.4,1) forwards}
@keyframes stamp{to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1) rotate(-8deg)}}

/* results */
.res{margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,80px)}
.res[hidden]{display:none}
.res h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,54px)}
.boxpic{margin:0 0 28px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:21/8;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px #000}
.boxpic img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 55%;display:block;transform:scale(1.06);transition:transform 1.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.res.open .boxpic img{transform:scale(1)}
@media (max-width:860px){.boxpic{aspect-ratio:3/2}}
.box{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.25fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(18px,3vw,36px);align-items:stretch}
.main{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.1fr);gap:24px;padding:28px;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.main .ribbon{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:50%;width:18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6f151a,var(--wax2),#6f151a);opacity:.0}
.main img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:contain;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 10px #fff}
.tag{font:500 10.5px/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--wax)}
.main h3{font:500 clamp(26px,2.6vw,34px)/1.1 var(--serif);margin:.35em 0 .15em}
.vend{font:500 12px/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute)}
.price{font:500 22px var(--serif);margin:12px 0 4px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.why{margin:14px 0 18px;padding:0;list-style:none;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d372e;display:grid;gap:6px}
.why li{padding-left:18px;position:relative}
.why li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.62em;width:8px;height:1px;background:var(--gold)}
.alts{display:grid;gap:14px;align-content:start}
.alt{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;align-items:center;background:rgba(244,237,224,.06);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px;text-decoration:none}
.alt:hover{border-color:rgba(191,154,85,.6)}
.alt:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold2);outline-offset:2px}
.alt img{width:110px;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:contain;background:#fff}
.alt .tag{color:var(--gold)}
.alt b{display:block;font:500 19px/1.2 var(--serif);margin:.35em 0 .2em}
.alt span{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mist)}
.alt .pr{color:var(--paper);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.after{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 26px;align-items:center;margin-top:26px;font-size:14px;color:var(--mist)}
.after a,.after button{background:none;border:0;padding:6px 0;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;color:var(--paper)}
.gift{margin-top:22px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mist);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:16px}
.gift b{color:var(--gold2);font-weight:500}
.ghost{display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;border:1px solid var(--wax);color:var(--wax);text-decoration:none;font:500 12px/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase}
.ghost:hover{background:var(--wax);color:var(--paper)}
.sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)}

@media (max-width:860px){
  .stage{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .letter{order:-1;min-height:0;transform:none;padding-bottom:48px}
  .lines{min-height:0;font-size:24px;line-height:34px}
  .sig{font-size:24px;line-height:34px}
  .letter{padding:40px 34px 62px;transform:rotate(.5deg)}
  .box{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .main{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:22px}
  .main img{max-width:260px;margin:0 auto}
  .seal{width:76px;height:76px;bottom:-28px}
}
@media (max-width:480px){.alt{grid-template-columns:84px minmax(0,1fr)}.alt img{width:84px}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .lines li{animation:none;width:auto;white-space:normal}
  .seal.on{animation:none;opacity:1;transform:rotate(-8deg)}
  .bar i{transition:none}
}
.brandrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.brand img{display:block;width:clamp(130px,14vw,170px);height:auto}
.letter{padding-inline:clamp(40px,6.5vw,90px)}
.lines li{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
@media (max-width:860px){.letter{padding-inline:34px}}
.sharebox{margin-top:26px;display:grid;gap:14px;justify-items:start}
.sharealt{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 18px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--mist)}
.sharealt a,.sharealt button{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--paper);padding:11px 16px;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;font:inherit}
.sharealt a:hover,.sharealt button:hover{border-color:var(--gold)}
.langs{display:flex;gap:2px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.langs a{padding:8px 6px;font:400 11px/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--mist);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
.langs a[aria-current]{color:var(--paper);border-bottom-color:var(--gold)}
.langs a[lang=ar],.langs a[lang=he]{letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px}
.empty{grid-column:1/-1;color:var(--paper);font:400 20px/1.4 var(--serif)}
[dir=rtl] .opt{text-align:right}
[dir=rtl] .why li{padding-left:0;padding-right:18px}[dir=rtl] .why li::before{left:auto;right:0}
[dir=rtl] .seal{right:auto;left:clamp(26px,5vw,60px)}
html[lang=ar] .lines,html[lang=ar] .sig{font-family:'Aref Ruqaa',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,2.4vw,30px)}
html[lang=he] .lines,html[lang=he] .sig{font-family:'Playpen Sans Hebrew','Frank Ruhl Libre',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,26px)}
html[lang=ar] body,html[lang=ar] h1,html[lang=ar] h2,html[lang=ar] h3,html[lang=ar] .alt b{font-family:Amiri,'Noto Naskh Arabic',serif}
html[lang=he] body,html[lang=he] h1,html[lang=he] h2,html[lang=he] h3,html[lang=he] .alt b{font-family:'Frank Ruhl Libre',serif}
[dir=rtl] .kick,[dir=rtl] .tag,[dir=rtl] .vend,[dir=rtl] .lhead,[dir=rtl] .go,[dir=rtl] .ghost{letter-spacing:0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="top">
    <div class="brandrow"><a class="brand" href="{{ routes.root_url }}" aria-label="BLACK ELIXIR – {%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}Home{%- when 'fr' -%}Accueil{%- when 'it' -%}Home{%- when 'da' -%}Forside{%- when 'ar' -%}الصفحة الرئيسية{%- when 'he' -%}דף הבית{%- else -%}Zur Startseite{%- endcase -%}"><img src="{{ images['BLACK_ELIXIR_LOGO_Transp._White_2.png'] | image_url: width: 400 }}" alt="BLACK ELIXIR" width="200" height="80"></a><nav class="langs" aria-label="Language">{%- for l in localization.available_languages -%}{%- assign lc = l.iso_code | slice: 0, 2 -%}{%- assign lr = l.root_url -%}{%- if lr == '/' -%}{%- assign lr = '' -%}{%- endif -%}<a href="{{ lr }}{{ page.url }}" lang="{{ lc }}" hreflang="{{ l.iso_code }}"{% if lc == gf_l %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>{%- case lc -%}{%- when 'de' -%}DE{%- when 'en' -%}EN{%- when 'fr' -%}FR{%- when 'it' -%}IT{%- when 'da' -%}DA{%- when 'ar' -%}عربي{%- when 'he' -%}עברית{%- else -%}{{ lc | upcase }}{%- endcase -%}</a>{%- endfor -%}</nav></div>
    <a class="skip" id="skip" href="{{ gf_root }}/collections/geschenk-bis-zu-100">{%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}Skip to all gifts{%- when 'fr' -%}Aller directement à tous les cadeaux{%- when 'it' -%}Vai direttamente a tutti i regali{%- when 'da' -%}Gå direkte til alle gaver{%- when 'ar' -%}انتقل مباشرةً إلى كل الهدايا{%- when 'he' -%}ישר לכל המתנות{%- else -%}Direkt zu allen Geschenken{%- endcase -%}</a>
  </header>

  <div class="stage">
    <section class="q" id="q" aria-live="polite">
      <span class="kick">{%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}Gift Finder{%- when 'fr' -%}Guide cadeaux{%- when 'it' -%}Trova regalo{%- when 'da' -%}Gavefinder{%- when 'ar' -%}دليل الهدايا{%- when 'he' -%}מוצא המתנות{%- else -%}Geschenk-Finder{%- endcase -%}</span>
      <h1>{%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}The{%- when 'fr' -%}La{%- when 'it' -%}La{%- when 'da' -%}Dit{%- when 'ar' -%}رسالة{%- when 'he' -%}מכתב{%- else -%}Der{%- endcase -%} <i>{%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}Wish Letter{%- when 'fr' -%}Lettre de vœux{%- when 'it' -%}Lettera dei desideri{%- when 'da' -%}Ønskebrev{%- when 'ar' -%}الأمنيات{%- when 'he' -%}המשאלות{%- else -%}Wunschbrief{%- endcase -%}</i></h1>
      <p class="lead">{%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}Answer up to five quick questions. With every answer, your letter to our perfumers writes itself a little further, and at the end we open the box with three suggestions from our range.{%- when 'fr' -%}Réponds à cinq petites questions au plus. À chaque réponse, ta lettre à nos parfumeurs s'écrit un peu plus, et à la fin nous ouvrons la boîte avec trois suggestions de notre sélection.{%- when 'it' -%}Rispondi a un massimo di cinque brevi domande. A ogni risposta la tua lettera ai nostri profumieri si scrive un po' di più, e alla fine apriamo la scatola con tre proposte dal nostro assortimento.{%- when 'da' -%}Besvar op til fem korte spørgsmål. Med hvert svar skriver dit brev til vores parfumører sig lidt videre, og til sidst åbner vi æsken med tre forslag fra vores sortiment.{%- when 'ar' -%}أجب عن خمسة أسئلة قصيرة على الأكثر. مع كل إجابة تكتمل رسالتك إلى صانعي العطور لدينا سطرًا بعد سطر، وفي النهاية نفتح العلبة على ثلاثة اقتراحات من تشكيلتنا.{%- when 'he' -%}ענה על עד חמש שאלות קצרות. כל תשובה מוסיפה שורה למכתב שלך אל יוצרי הבשמים שלנו, ובסוף נפתח את הקופסה עם שלוש הצעות מהמבחר שלנו.{%- else -%}Beantworte bis zu fünf kurze Fragen. Mit jeder Antwort schreibt sich dein Brief an unsere Parfumeure weiter, und am Ende öffnen wir die Schachtel mit drei Vorschlägen aus unserem Sortiment.{%- endcase -%}</p>
      <button class="go" id="start" type="button">{%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}Start the letter{%- when 'fr' -%}Commencer la lettre{%- when 'it' -%}Inizia la lettera{%- when 'da' -%}Begynd brevet{%- when 'ar' -%}ابدأ الرسالة{%- when 'he' -%}להתחיל את המכתב{%- else -%}Brief beginnen{%- endcase -%}</button>
    </section>

    <article class="letter" aria-label="{%- case gf_l -%}{%- when 'en' -%}Your wish letter{%- when 'fr' -%}Ta lettre de vœux{%- when 'it' -%}La tua lettera dei desideri{%- when 'da' -%}Dit ønskebrev{%- when 'ar' -%}رسالة أمنياتك{%- when 'he' -%}מכתב המשאלות שלך{%- else -%}Dein Wunschbrief{%- endcase -%}">
